This installer places the Clinging video editor and its bundled FFmpeg / ffprobe binaries into your own user profile:\par
\par
[LocalAppData]\\Programs\\Clinging\par
\par
It does not require administrator rights, does not touch the system PATH, and does not write outside the current user profile. Uninstalling removes only the program files listed above; your projects (*.clinq) and the media cache stay where you saved them.\par
